[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: a GLB mesh whose lightmap unwrap the project commits no `.unwrap_cache` for.
; `meshes/light_baking=2` makes Godot unwrap the box with xatlas on import, which the previewer
; does not run, so the box reads no lightmap and draws with ambient light alone, where the bake
; of `unit-lightmap-gi-baked.lmbake` names it. The Static sun lights neither mesh in real time.
; The ground still reads its lightmap. No other scene has a lightmap-named mesh without a
; rebuilt unwrap, so none shows this mesh read a lightmap through a UV2 that is not Godot's.

